1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,835
Electronics mein diploma hai, par koi achha kaam nahi.

2
00:00:04,135 --> 00:00:10,676
Mohit, aajkal har dukaan, har ghar ko CCTV chahiye! Camera lagaane ka kaam shuru kar!

3
00:00:10,976 --> 00:00:14,232
Uncle, badi companiyon se kaise muqabla karunga?

4
00:00:14,532 --> 00:00:20,245
Local service se! Ek phone pe pahunch jaana. Tools aur stock, 50 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:20,545 --> 00:00:29,343
Mobile pe live dekhna sikhana, grahak ko yahi sabse pasand aata hai. Saath mein smart lock aur light bhi bech.

6
00:00:29,893 --> 00:00:33,914
Mohit beta, jewellery ki dukaan hai. Choron se darr lagta hai!

7
00:00:34,213 --> 00:00:38,689
Chaar camere, night vision, mobile pe live. 20 hazaar, lagwa ke!

8
00:00:38,989 --> 00:00:44,380
Ek installation pe 5 hazaar tak. Mahine ke 20 kaam, yaani ek lakh!

9
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:49,292
Phir saalana maintenance ka contract bech. Har saal pakki kamai.

10
00:00:49,592 --> 00:00:52,972
Sabki suraksha, meri tarakki! Mohit ki life set!
